TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water, fixed PO2, allow Goethite+Gypsum precip, report SI(Hematite)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water initial
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1 Fixed O2
    -fixed_pressure true
    -pressure 1
    O2(g) -0.7
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -si Hematite
END
